// Football Manager 27 (27.0.1) layout. Notes: docs/fm27-notes.md
// Players are found by scanning for db::ACTUAL_PLAYER objects (vtable located through RTTI).
// Paths are relative to the start of the ACTUAL_PLAYER object.
{
